# Hookline Stack's barrow cut (CIPlay hookline_stack_caves, 11-11). Run it in a new world whose name does NOT start with
# 'CI ' (e.g. 'W04 hkcaves'): in a 'CI ' world each `island` line empties the inventory and Fleetbreak's machete is lost
# on the way. Points as in its recipe (the origin frame): the vine mouth at 42.5 0.5 on the yard's side of the spoil
# heap's south-east end, the straight cut (open at both ends) north-north-east to the shore at 57.8 24, the salvager's
# box halfway at 51.1 11.5. The machete comes from Fleetbreak Moorings' bosun's locker, as in the plan.
# Shut by the vines, cut, walked through, box opened, walked back.
island Fleetbreak Moorings
offset 0 0
open Bosun's locker
wait 3
expect item Machete 1

island Hookline Stack
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
where ChoppableVines

# The yard mouth: shut by the vines
picture hk_cave_out 36 5 -8 44 4 3
walk 39.8 -3.7 to 42.5 0.5 to 46.3 6.4 blocked
expect shown hkcut_vines
use hkcut_vines
expect hidden hkcut_vines
picture hk_cave_cut 36 5 -8 44 4 3
# Through the cut to the shore, the box on the way
walk 39.8 -3.7 to 42.5 0.5 to 46.3 6.4 to 50.1 12.2 to 53.9 18.1 to 57.8 24 to 60.5 28.2
picture hk_cave_in 44 4.5 3.6 52 4 15 light=20
picture hk_cave_far 63 4.5 32 55 3.5 20
open Barrow cut box
wait 2
expect item Scrap 4
# Back through to the yard
walk 57.8 24 to 53.9 18.1 to 50.1 12.2 to 46.3 6.4 to 42.5 0.5 to 39.8 -3.7
